WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.562
The ethics screen problem.

00:00:02.512 --> 00:00:07.887
The screen covers only 103 of Brookfield's 500-plus entities.

00:00:07.887 --> 00:00:12.812
The administrators don't know what's in the fund tied to Carney's performance pay.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:20.950
Carney met alone with Brookfield's COO in October 2025 — the Ethics Commissioner acknowledged it should not have happened.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:27.200
A budget bill contained a tax credit benefiting a Brookfield-owned firm and the commissioner was unaware.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.012
Brookfield's green transition funds use Bermuda-based tax structures.

00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:38.775
Democracy Watch filed an Access to Information request — the government extended the deadline to stall.
